<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'60px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei', display:'flex', flexDirection:'column' }}>
<Box style={{ height:46, flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'baseline', gap:18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>详细设计：AI 分析模块</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 5.7 节 · G1–G7 与降级链路</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FTDMS · 总体设计报告</Text><Image src="assets/logo_icon.png" style={{ width: 36, height: 36, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:1, background:'#CFD9D2', marginTop:8, marginBottom:20 }}></Box>
<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:240, flexDirection:'row', gap:36 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>关键类与职责</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>AiController：授权 / 撤回 / 生成 / 历史 / 详情 / 删除<br />AiService：授权状态机、生成编排、报告查询与 notice 重算<br />AiSummaryBuilder：按 F 族口径构建 DS15 摘要 JSON<br />AiContentGuard：输出与摘要核对，数值冲突不作为确定结论</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>状态与降级</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>未授权 → GRANTED → REVOKED，撤回后可重新授权<br />未授权或已撤回返回 5001；有效记录少于 3 天返回 5003<br />SUCCESS / DEGRADED / FAILED；FAILED 不落库<br />模型超时保留统计值、content 为空；报告可物理删除</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:204, flexDirection:'column', gap:0 }}><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 160 }}>先算后解释</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>训练、营养、体重与有效天数由后端算好，模型只组织文字</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 160 }}>不足即说明</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>有效天数不足 3 天返回 5003；缺失日期标注「未记录」</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 160 }}>不一致不采信</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>模型输出与 summary_json 核对，数值冲突不展示为结论</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 160 }}>不可用即降级</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>模型不可达保留统计值、状态记 DEGRADED，不编造报告</Text></Box></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:50, marginTop:9, background:'#F4F8F5', flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', padding:'0 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>AI 模块的价值在可复算与可降级，而不是把算数交给模型。</Text></Box>
</Slide>
